{
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-25T07:24:43.292375+00:00",
  "status": "Task fact labels readable in board cards; all-task denominator explicit",
  "changes": [
    "Two CSS rules apply the existing two-column fact arrangement to narrow board cards, including desktop. The third fact spans the row. Full physician patient cards retain three columns.",
    "Without-follow-up caption now states33 out of all38 tasks. The observed completed37 and due-for-check3 denominators remain distinct and unchanged. Backend aggregation was reviewed; no formula or source changed."
  ],
